<title>BELGIUM: Banque Generale du Luxembourg higher 1996 profit.</title>
<headline>Banque Generale du Luxembourg higher 1996 profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Generale du Luxembourg said on Friday its profits rose 12.1 percent to 3.367 billion Luxembourg francs in calendar 1996.</p>
<p>It said that as a result it would raise its gross dividend by 17 percent to 1,380 francs per share.</p>
<p>Banque Generale du Luxembourg is controlled by Belgium's Generale Bank.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
